<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαζάω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι-ζώω</span></b> , inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαζῆν,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live through, pass,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθῶς τὸν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					923
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ καθ᾽ ἡμέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					561c
				</span></i>
			, etc.: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλῶς δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.1.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
			part., <i>live</i> by doing so and so, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιηφαγέοντες διέζωον</span> they
				<i>supported life</i> by . ., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀπό τινος</span>
			<i>live</i> off or by a thing, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				535
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1434
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.187
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς οὖν διέζης ἢ πόθεν μηδὲν ποιῶν;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					906
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. νομῇ</span> of pastoral
				<i>life,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				679a
			</span></i>.</div>
